ྱལ་བའི་ཡེ་ཤེས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dbas rgyal ba'i ye shes</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sbas rgyal ba'i ye shes</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sba' rgyal ba'i ye shes</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgya ba ye shes</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4229</idno></person><person xml:id="person4230"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">cog gru rgyal ba'i ye shes</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཅོག་གྲུ་རྒྱལ་བའི་ཡེ་ཤེས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gru rgyal ba'i ye shes</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10003</idno><idno type="APIS">4230</idno></person><person xml:id="person4231"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">cog gru mchog gi ye shes</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཅོག་གྲུ་མཆོག་གི་ཡེ་ཤེས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P8LS13537</idno><idno type="APIS">4231</idno></person><person xml:id="person4232"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">se btsun dbang phyug gzhon nu</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">སེ་བཙུན་དབང་ཕྱུག་གཞོན་ནུ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">se btsun gzhon nu dbang phyug</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">jo bo se btsun</persName><birth notBefore="0935-01-01" notAfter="1054-12-31">after 935 before 1054</birth><death notBefore="1015-01-01" notAfter="1134-12-31">after 1015 before 1134</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10004</idno><idno type="APIS">4232</idno></person><person xml:id="person4234"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'gar mi yon tan g.yung drung</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">འགར་མི་ཡོན་ཏན་གཡུང་དྲུང</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gar mi yon tan g.yung drung</persName><birth notBefore="1000-01-01" notAfter="1065-12-31">after 1000 before 1065</birth><death notBefore="1021-01-01" notAfter="1100-12-31">after 1021 before 1100</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10005</idno><idno type="APIS">4234</idno><note type="comment">Major exponent of the Abhidharmasamuccaya (ID:3755) ([K9NNDTDS]: 1389).</note></person><person xml:id="person4235"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khu ston brtson 'grus g.yung drung</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཁུ་སྟོན་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་གཡུང་དྲུང</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khu brtson 'grus g.yung drung</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khu ston chen po brtson 'grus g.yung drung</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khu lha sdings pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khu chen po lha sdings pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khu ston shes rab brtson 'grus</persName><birth notBefore="1011-01-01" notAfter="1011-12-31">1011</birth><death notBefore="1075-01-01" notAfter="1075-12-31">1075</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3464</idno><idno type="APIS">4235</idno><note type="comment">The Abhidharma lineage found in (ID:5483) names "khu lha sdings pa brtson 'grus g.yung drung" between "gar mi yon tan g.yung drung" (ID:4234) and "rgya rgyal bu tshul le" (ID:4238). &#13;
The lineage in work (ID:5264) places him between " 'gar mi yon tan g.yung drung" (ID:4234) and both "ra" (ID:4237) and "rgya" (ID:4238).&#13;
&#13;
We consider "khu lha sdings pa" to be the same person as "khu ston brtson 'grus g.yung drung," who founded lHa sdings (ID:6701) in Yar lung.&#13;
&#13;
He is also mistakenly given the name Khu ston shes rab brtson 'grus in a lineage list, but should not be confused with (ID:3823) ([TZC3JQWE]: 342).</note></person><person xml:id="person4237"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ra khri bzang 'bar</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ར་ཁྲི་བཟང་འབར</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rwa khri bzang 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ra</persName><birth notAfter="1065-12-31">before 1065</birth><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10008</idno><idno type="APIS">4237</idno><note type="comment">Van der Kuijp ([K9NNDTDS]: 1397 and n. 36) considers that "Khri bzang 'bar" cannot be a Buddhist name in religion, and that this person must have been a layman.</note></person><person xml:id="person4238"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgya tshul li</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རྒྱ་ཚུལ་ལི</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgyal ba tshul le</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgya rgyal bu tshul le</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10009</idno><idno type="APIS">4238</idno></person><person xml:id="person4239"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">li ston chos grags</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ལི་སྟོན་ཆོས་གྲགས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P10010</idno><idno type="APIS">4239</idno></person><person xml:id="person4241"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ko ye shes 'byung gnas</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཀོ་ཡེ་ཤེས་འབྱུང་གནས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ko bo ye shes 'byung gnas</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rko bo ye shes 'byung gnas</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">kho'o ye 'byung</per